  "details": "There are two things which kinda bothered me for a while now.\n\n1) It would be great if you could configure the default state of the finger tracking VRC gestures. Because most of the time when I switch to finger tracking I want to be stationary and not accidently click stuff. So it would be great if you could tell by an option to either have finger tracking gestures locked by default or remember the last state of the locking.\n\n2) I hate these ghost hand overlays. I am not sure whether they are generated by VRC itself but it would be great if it was possible to just disable those ghost hands completely, or maybe someone knows how to get rid of them?",
